!slide SETTINGS: box-width AND box-height
box-width
box-height

Here "box-width" refer to both title-width and content-width... or height.
Substitute box according to your needs. The box width and height is calculated
according to the following formula:  

0:        will make the box as large as the terminal allows
positive: will make the box as large as asked, no matter what
negative: will make the box smaller than the terminal by the negative amount

Lets see some examples
#
#
#
!slide SETTINGS: box-width AND box-height, EXAMPLES
